    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20282" body-key="">
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόλῐμοι</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκαι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβόλιμοι δ.</span>
			, <i>deferred, adjourned</i> suits, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρχ. Ἐφ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1911.133
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Gonni</span>): <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόλῐμον</span></b> , τό,
				<i>period of delay</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				37.204
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Chios</span>): hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βολῐμοδῐκασταί</span></b> , οἱ, <i>judges who try</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. δίκαι, Ἀρχ. Ἐφ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1911.129
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Gonni</span>).</div>
